---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — al-Nizam"
  description="How to reach al-Nizam."
  theme="light"
>
  <PageHeader kicker="al-Nizam" title="Contact" />

  <article>
    <p class="lead">
      A dedicated contact channel is being put in place. In the meantime,
      here is the best way to follow and reach the work.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <p>
      The <a href="/leadership/">Leadership Channel</a> is the clearest window
      into al-Nizam — long-form pieces on the disciplines the framework has
      evolved. New writing lands there first.
    </p>

    <p>
      To understand the person behind the framework, see the
      <a href="/founder">Founder</a> page.
    </p>

    <p>
      A direct inquiry address will be published here soon. Thank you for your
      patience while al-Nizam's public presence comes online.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
